            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2378233?u=b710595115ea1340bfcc94691dbb8291b27dac2f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fix and clarify the <code class=\"notranslate\">counter_support</code> description for <code class=\"notranslate\">::marker</code> by aligning it with BCD style guidelines and removing inline MDN links.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change is non-functional and only affects metadata (<code class=\"notranslate\">description</code> field).<br>\nVerified consistency with existing entries such as <code class=\"notranslate\">quotes_support</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">animation_and_transition_support</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updated description now:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>avoids inline markdown links (not used in BCD)</li>\n<li>explicitly mentions <code class=\"notranslate\">::marker</code> context</li>\n<li>follows concise and consistent phrasing</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">N/A</p>",
