        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added support for <code class=\"notranslate\">xywh()</code> function as a value for <code class=\"notranslate\">shape-outside</code> property</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested using <a href=\"https://codepen.io/CodeRedDigital/pen/KwgmemP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">shape-outside</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">xywh()</code> pen</a>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 149.0b6 (aarch64) - Passed</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 149.0b6 - Passed</li>\n<li>Firefox Nightly 150.0a1 (2026-03-17) - Passed</li>\n<li>Safari 17.3 - Passed - <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-17_2-release-notes#:~:text=xywh()%20shape%20for%20shape-outside\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safari 17.2 release note</a></li>\n<li>Chrome Canary 148.0.7737.0 - <strong>Failed</strong></li>\n<li>Edge Canary 148.0.3922.0 - <strong>Failed</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43481\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43481/hovercard\">Firefox Release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29284",
            "title": "added xywh() value to shape-outside",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-18T10:50:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T16:57:41.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chromium sometimes repositions elements with <code class=\"notranslate\">position-area</code> even if no anchor is found.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I used the test case in <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/388575663\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/388575663</a> to confirm that the bug is still present.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/388575663\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium bug 388575663</a></li>\n<li>Toward <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3647585549\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558/hovercard?comment_id=3647042903&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558#issuecomment-3647042903\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3558 (comment)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29283",
            "title": "`position-area`: note Chromium bug with absolutely positioned elements",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-17T16:03:31.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T16:02:52.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This captures the specification change, where anchor positioning happens after layout, such as zooms or transforms. Originally reported in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3650713048\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499\">#28499</a>.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This spec change occurred in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1625424788\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584/hovercard?comment_id=3109444615&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/8584#issuecomment-3109444615\">w3c/csswg-drafts#8584 (comment)</a>. The spec text can be found in <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-anchor-position/#anchor-position-size:~:text=The%20anchor%20box%E2%80%99s%20position%20and%20size%20is%20determined%20after%20layout%2E\" rel=\"nofollow\">the paragraph beginning with</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The anchor box’s position and size is determined after layout.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chromium appears to be the only engine implementing. See <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/382294252#comment7\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium bug 1993692 (comment #7)</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993692\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 1993692</a> tracks this in Gecko.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I found three related bugs against WebKit, but none are confirmed or accepted. Since I don't know which one will ultimately be worked on, I used them all for <code class=\"notranslate\">impl_url</code>. See related issues below for a complete list.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28499.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3650713048\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28499\">#28499</a></li>\n<li>Toward <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3647585549\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558/hovercard?comment_id=3647042903&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558#issuecomment-3647042903\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3558 (comment)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/382294252#comment7\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium bug 382294252</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1993692\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 1993692</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=289743\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 289743</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=309921\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 309921</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=307660\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 307660</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29282",
            "title": "`anchor-name`: add `position_after_layout` behavioral subfeature",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-17T16:15:02.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T15:44:56.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A specification change to anchor positioning now requires that if a non-<code class=\"notranslate\">none</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">position-area</code> applies to an element, then <code class=\"notranslate\">margin: auto</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">inset: auto</code> to <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-anchor-position/#:~:text=available%0Afor%20positioning.-,the%20used%20value%20of%20any%20auto%20inset%20properties%20and%20auto%20margin%20properties%20resolves%20to%200.,-The%20normal%20value\" rel=\"nofollow\">resolve to 0</a>. This PR captures support for this behavior in a behavior subfeature.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Spec</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The spec text is <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-anchor-position/#:~:text=available%0Afor%20positioning.-,the%20used%20value%20of%20any%20auto%20inset%20properties%20and%20auto%20margin%20properties%20resolves%20to%200.,-The%20normal%20value\" rel=\"nofollow\">this bullet point</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The used value of any 'auto' inset properties and 'auto' margin properties resolves to '0'.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It followed <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2266340227\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258/hovercard?comment_id=3407160892&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258#issuecomment-3407160892\">w3c/csswg-drafts#10258 (comment)</a>.</p>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Chrome</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\">According to <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/374574260#comment18\" rel=\"nofollow\">bug 374574260 (comment #18)</a> Chrome appears to have supported this behavior—or something close it—in its initial anchor positioning implementation. Then the spec changed <em>twice</em>, bringing back this original behavior.</p>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Firefox</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The actual support for this comes out of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1997481\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 1997481</a>, though the changes to make the test pass came about in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2006398\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 2006398</a>.</p>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\">Safari</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=300823\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 300823</a> tracks this; it was fixed by <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3519663143\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/52419\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/52419/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/52419\">WebKit/WebKit#52419</a>. I determined the version number where it ultimately shipped from the <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#:~:text=Fixed%20auto%20margins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Safari 26.2 Release Notes</a>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Via <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3647585549\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3558</a></li>\n<li>Spec resolution: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2266340227\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258/hovercard?comment_id=3407160892&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10258#issuecomment-3407160892\">w3c/csswg-drafts#10258 (comment)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/374574260#comment18\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chromium bug 374574260 (comment #18)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1997481\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 1997481</a> and <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2006398\" rel=\"nofollow\">bug 2006398</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=300823\" rel=\"nofollow\">WebKit bug 300823</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3519663143\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/issues/52419\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/52419/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/52419\">WebKit/WebKit#52419</a>.</li>\n<li>Loosely related to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4083024202\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29272\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29272/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29272\">#29272</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29280",
            "title": "`position-area`: add behavioral subfeature for auto margins",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-17T14:40:32.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T14:39:36.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
                "url": "https://github.com/ddbeck"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>added firefox support for <code class=\"notranslate\">@container style()</code> queries</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested with <a href=\"https://cdpn.io/pen/debug/pvEPvGm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@container style()</code> test</a> in:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox nightly 150.0a1 (2026-03-16) (no flag)</li>\n<li>Firefox Developer Edition 149.0b6 (with <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.style-queries.enabled</code>)\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox Beta 149.0b6 (with <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.style-queries.enabled</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43473\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/43473/hovercard\">Firefox release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29279",
            "title": "updated ff support for @container style()",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-18T10:50:57.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T12:10:56.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF149 adds support parsing and serialization support, but not rendering, for the shorthand CSS property <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">text-box</code></a> , corresponding longhand properties <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box-trim\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">text-box-trim</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/text-box-edge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">text-box-edge</code></a>, and the value <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/text-edge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">text-edge</code></a> behind the preference <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.css.text-box.enabled</code> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013458\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013458</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This updates the features indicating partial support and the implementation URL that will give full support. Obviously that will disappear when this releases.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Collector tests appear to pass when the pref is enabled:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-trim\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-trim</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-edge\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box-edge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mdn-bcd-collector.gooborg.com/tests/css/properties/text-box</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3977998210\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43208\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43208/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43208\">mdn/content#43208</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29274",
            "title": "FF149 CSS text-box -edge/-trim behind pref",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-19T23:46:02.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-17T04:50:11.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">position-anchor: normal</code> was the initial value, but now it's spec'd as <code class=\"notranslate\">position-anchor: none</code>. This covers the discrepancy between browsers.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I didn't actually test this, I just figured it out based on the bugs and it aligned with the support data for <code class=\"notranslate\">none</code>.</p>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3647585549\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3558\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3558</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1999972\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1999972</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/460415950\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/460415950</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=308981\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=308981</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3593088587\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13067\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13067/hovercard?comment_id=3525018605&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13067#issuecomment-3525018605\">w3c/csswg-drafts#13067 (comment)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29272",
            "title": "`position-anchor`: capture change in initial value",
            "date_modified": "2026-03-17T14:46:16.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-03-16T15:01:31.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "ddbeck",
